{"cluster_id": "C-3174", "topic": "read path claim", "target": "architecture/read-path", "member_ids": ["B017-036"], "canonical_claim": "`cas_run` remains a streaming object: it has `object_cap = 0`, is read sequentially one NDJSON line at a time, and keeps only O(one line) resident.", "issue_ids": [], "sources": ["docs/superpowers/plans/2026-07-15-cas-codecs-v3-phase5-runs.md#streaming-seek-reconciliation"]}
